	(descr "Littelfuse NANO2 451/453 series 2410 (6125 metric) surface mount fuse, body 6.10 x 2.69 x 2.69 mm. Pads are the recommended land pattern from the 451/453 datasheet: 1.96 x 3.15 mm on 2.45 mm centres, 2.95 mm inner gap, 6.86 mm overall span. Fitted part is 0453.250MR. Derived from the SnapEDA FUSC6125X279N pattern for Bel Fuse 0679L5000-05, which is the same 2410 body and whose pad centres agreed to within 0.005 mm; the pad sizes here follow Littelfuse instead.")
